1-\E_{(\line, \line_X, \line_Z) \sim D} &\E_{(x,z,\alpha, \beta) \in \line} \sum_{b} \bra{\hat{\psi}}  T^{\line_X, \line_Z, z}_{b} \ot \hat{M}^{(\Point,Z),z}_{b} \ket{\hat{\psi}}\notag\\
